# Enterprise AI Data Analyst Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Perform a massive upgrade to the existing AI Data Analyst platform according to the 15-phase requirement list. The goal is to make the system fully dynamic (no hardcoded schemas), highly reliable (self-healing, EXPLAIN validation), enterprise-grade (Enterprise RAG, full downloads), and feature a highly professional UI/UX that matches modern top-tier applications (ChatGPT, Cursor).

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The database schema extraction will be modified to scan the **complete database** instead of relying on `ALLOWED_TABLE_NAMES`. This could take longer during the first startup depending on the size of the database.
> The UI will undergo a significant overhaul to implement a clean, professional dark/light mode interface. 

